WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.890
It was a rainy day.

2
00:00:04.891 --> 00:00:09.310
Rover wanted to go outside.

3
00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:12.247
"No, Rover," said Emmy.

4
00:00:12.248 --> 00:00:17.176
"We have to play inside today."

5
00:00:17.177 --> 00:00:20.841
Rover followed Emmy into the kitchen.

6
00:00:20.842 --> 00:00:26.794
Oliver and Harry were eating lunch.

7
00:00:26.795 --> 00:00:30.659
"Let's make banana bread," Emmy said.

8
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.329
"Yeah!" said the boys.

9
00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:38.903
Emmy beat the eggs.

10
00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:44.380
Harry mashed the bananas.

11
00:00:44.381 --> 00:00:47.761
Oliver got out the flour.

12
00:00:47.762 --> 00:00:50.423
Rover tried to help.

13
00:00:50.424 --> 00:01:06.218
But he got covered in flour!

14
00:01:06.219 --> 00:01:11.304
"Now let's paint something," Emmy said.

15
00:01:11.305 --> 00:01:17.818
She got out paper and paints.

16
00:01:17.819 --> 00:01:20.840
Oliver painted a pirate ship.

17
00:01:20.841 --> 00:01:23.925
Emmy painted some flowers.

18
00:01:23.926 --> 00:01:27.538
Harry painted a baseball player.

19
00:01:27.539 --> 00:01:30.121
Rover tried to help.

20
00:01:30.122 --> 00:01:34.539
But he got covered in paint!

21
00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:39.148
"I think Rover is bored," said Oliver.

22
00:01:39.149 --> 00:01:41.589
Emmy nodded.

23
00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:44.914
"I know what to do next," she said.

24
00:01:44.915 --> 00:01:49.432
"Let's give Rover a bath."

25
00:01:49.433 --> 00:01:54.598
Emmy filled the tub with water.

26
00:01:54.599 --> 00:01:59.604
Oliver put soap in the water.

27
00:01:59.605 --> 00:02:05.044
Harry put Rover in the water.

28
00:02:05.045 --> 00:02:08.454
But Rover didn't like the tub.

29
00:02:08.455 --> 00:02:13.322
Water splashed. Soap sprayed.

30
00:02:13.323 --> 00:02:22.046
Rover slipped and slid!

31
00:02:22.047 --> 00:02:26.083
Finally Emmy opened the back door.

32
00:02:26.084 --> 00:02:30.594
"Go, Rover!" she said.

33
00:02:30.595 --> 00:02:34.629
Rover ran out into the rain.

34
00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:38.990
"Now Rover is having fun," said Emmy.

35
00:02:38.991 --> 00:02:47.362
"And he's getting a bath!" said Oliver.

